    "cli.hooks.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nManage and run UniConnect agent hooks without adding one top-level command per\nagent. Claude Code hooks are injected automatically by the UniConnect Claude wrapper.\n\nAgents:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nHook targets:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nGenerated files:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nExamples:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الاستخدام: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nإدارة وتشغيل عمليات ربط الوكيل UniConnect دون إضافة أمر واحد من المستوى الأعلى لكل\nوكيل. Claude يتم إدخال خطافات التعليمات البرمجية تلقائيًا بواسطة الغلاف UniConnect Claude.\n\nالوكلاء:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nأهداف الخطاف:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nالملفات التي تم إنشاؤها:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nأمثلة:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upotreba: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nUpravljajte i pokrenite UniConnect agentske kuke bez dodavanja jedne naredbe najvišeg nivoa po\nagent. Claude Kuke koda se automatski ubrizgavaju pomoću UniConnect Claude omotača.\n\nAgenti:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nUdica meta:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nGenerirani fajlovi:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nprimjeri:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anvendelse: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nAdministrer og kør UniConnect agenthooks uden at tilføje én kommando på øverste niveau pr.\nagent. Claude Kodekroge indsprøjtes automatisk af UniConnect Claude indpakningen.\n\nAgenter:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nKrogmål:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nGenererede filer:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwendung: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nVerwalten und führen Sie UniConnect Agent-Hooks aus, ohne jeweils einen Befehl der obersten Ebene hinzuzufügen\nAgent. Claude Code-Hooks werden automatisch vom Wrapper UniConnect Claude eingefügt.\n\nAgenten:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nHook-Ziele:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nErzeugte Dateien:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nBeispiele:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uso: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nGestiona y ejecuta hooks de agentes de UniConnect sin añadir un comando de nivel superior por agente. Los hooks de Claude Code se inyectan automáticamente mediante el wrapper de Claude de UniConnect.\n\nAgentes:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nDestinos de hooks:\n  setup              Instala hooks para todos los agentes compatibles presentes en PATH\n  uninstall          Elimina los hooks de todos los agentes compatibles\n  <agent> install    Instala la integración de un agente\n  <agent> uninstall  Elimina la integración de un agente\n  <agent> <event>    Punto de entrada interno usado por las configuraciones generadas\n  feed               Puente interno de decisiones de Feed\n\nArchivos generados:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  Consulta docs/agent-hooks.md para ver la matriz de integración completa.\n\nEjemplos:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisation : cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nGérez et exécutez UniConnect hooks d'agent sans ajouter une commande de niveau supérieur par\nmandataire. Claude Les hooks de code sont injectés automatiquement par le wrapper UniConnect Claude.\n\nAgents :\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nCibles de crochet :\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nFichiers générés :\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nExemples :\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilizzo: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nGestisci ed esegui UniConnect hook dell'agente senza aggiungere un comando di livello superiore per\nagente. Claude Gli hook di codice vengono inseriti automaticamente dal wrapper UniConnect Claude.\n\nAgenti:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nObiettivi del gancio:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nFile generati:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nEsempi:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用法: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nエージェント フックごとに最上位コマンドを 1 つ追加せずに、UniConnect エージェント フックを管理および実行します。\nエージェント。Claude コードフックは、UniConnect Claude ラッパーによって自動的に挿入されます。\n\nエージェント:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nフックターゲット:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\n生成されたファイル:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\n例:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ការប្រើប្រាស់៖ ការដំឡើងទំពក់ cmux [ភ្នាក់ងារ] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nគ្រប់គ្រង និងដំណើរការ UniConnect ទំពក់ភ្នាក់ងារដោយមិនបន្ថែមពាក្យបញ្ជាកម្រិតកំពូលមួយក្នុងមួយ\nភ្នាក់ងារ។Claude ទំពក់លេខកូដត្រូវបានចាក់ដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិដោយUniConnect Claude ។\n\nភ្នាក់ងារ៖:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nគោលដៅទំពក់៖:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nឯកសារដែលបានបង្កើត៖:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nឧទាហរណ៍៖:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사용법: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\n하나의 최상위 명령을 추가하지 않고도 UniConnect 에이전트 후크를 관리하고 실행합니다.\n대리인. Claude 코드 후크는 UniConnect Claude 래퍼에 의해 자동으로 삽입됩니다.\n\n대리인:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\n후크 대상:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\n생성된 파일:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\n예:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bruk: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nAdministrer og kjør UniConnect agenthooks uten å legge til én kommando på toppnivå pr.\nagent. Claude Kodekroker injiseres automatisk av UniConnect Claude omslag.\n\nAgenter:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nKrokmål:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nGenererte filer:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Użycie: cmux hooks setup [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks uninstall [agent] [--agent <name>] [--yes|-y]\n       cmux hooks <agent> install [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> uninstall [--yes|-y] (opencode supports --project)\n       cmux hooks <agent> <event> [flags]\n       cmux hooks feed --source <agent> [--event <event>]\n\nZarządzaj i uruchamiaj UniConnect zaczepy agentów bez dodawania jednego polecenia najwyższego poziomu na\nagent. Claude Haki kodu są wstrzykiwane automatycznie przez opakowanie UniConnect Claude.\n\nAgenci:\n  codex, grok, opencode, pi, omp, amp, cursor, gemini, kiro, antigravity (alias: agy), rovodev (alias: rovo), hermes-agent, copilot, codebuddy, factory, qoder\n\nCele haków:\n  setup              Install hooks for all supported agents on PATH\n  uninstall          Remove hooks for all supported agents\n  <agent> install    Install one agent integration\n  <agent> uninstall  Remove one agent integration\n  <agent> <event>    Internal hook entrypoint used by generated configs\n  feed               Internal Feed decision bridge\n\nWygenerowane pliki:\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-session.js\n  ~/.config/opencode/plugins/uniconnect-feed.js\n  ~/.pi/agent/extensions/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.omp/agent/extensions/uniconnect-omp-session.ts\n  ~/.config/amp/plugins/uniconnect-session.ts\n  ~/.kiro/agents/uniconnect.json\n  See docs/agent-hooks.md for the full integration matrix.\n\nPrzykłady:\n  cmux hooks setup\n  cmux hooks setup --agent codex\n  cmux hooks setup rovo\n  cmux hooks setup omp\n  cmux hooks uninstall rovo\n  cmux hooks codex install\n  cmux hooks opencode install --project\n  cmux hooks uninstall"
          }
